# A15 — Docker build context excludes
# Image küçük + build cache verimli olsun

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
.git
.github
.husky
.vscode
.idea
.claude
.mcp.json
.mcp.json.example
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Test results
test-results
playwright-report
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Local dev/test artifacts
apps/api/storage
apps/api/coverage*
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production
.env.prod

# Documents (not needed in container)
gelistirme-plani
hesaplamalar
docs

# Dev/ops tooling — uygulama değil; image'a (ve klinik kutusuna) ASLA girmez.
# Staging monitör (collector script'leri + dashboard) burada yaşar.
tools

# README + repo metadata (image içine girmesin)
*.md
!apps/*/README.md
